# The AI-generated (or hand-drawn) source images (Plan 11) fed into
# `apps/normal-web/scripts/avatar-pipeline.mjs`. They are *inputs*, not project state: what is
# committed is the layers that script emits under `apps/normal-web/public/avatar/`. README.md says
# where each one comes from and what tool and seed made it.
#
# `!.gitignore` is not decoration: without it this file would ignore itself and could not be
# committed, which would leave every original one `git add -A` away from the history.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
